# FINN — Environment Variables Configuration
# Set GEMINI_API_KEY as an environment variable (Render dashboard in production; terminal session locally). Never put it in a file.

# ── Primary API Key ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Provide via process environment variable only. Do NOT save to any file.
# GEMINI_API_KEY

# ── Optional Model Chain Overrides (defaults are set in code) ─────────────────
# GEMINI_CHEAP_CHAIN
# GEMINI_REASONING_CHAIN
# GEMINI_MODEL
# GEMINI_CHEAP_MODEL
# GEMINI_FALLBACK_MODELS

# ── Optional Deployment / CORS Overrides ──────────────────────────────────────
# FRONTEND_URL
# BACKEND_URL
